    "title": "Reference L1 show -- eight aircraft, one figure",
    "duration_ms": 120000,
    "notes": "The reference example for the profile most implementations will target. It exercises every construct 1.3 names for L1 -- segment trajectories, light programs, flight limits, geofence, takeoff grid, RTH and device-profile binding -- and nothing above it: no yaw, no payloads, no waves, no sorties. The figure is deliberately trivial (climb, transit, one circle, return) so that a reader can check an importer against it by hand."
